# Realm roles every realm must carry, and the machine identity that holds each.
# A realm file only seeds a FRESH realm (--import-realm skips existing ones), so
# a role a new component needs reaches running realms here: ops/keycloak/converge.sh
# creates the role where it is missing and grants it where the line says:
#   <role> <client-id>           to that client's service account (a machine)
#   <role> composite:<role>      into a composite role people hold (a desk's bundle)
#   <role> user:<username>       to one named user
# A role with nothing after it is only defined.
benefit:read
benefit:write bss-ordering
# the care desk reads a household's Choices (#358): the CSR bundle, and the all-round demo staff login
benefit:read composite:agent
benefit:read user:demo
